This repository implements the Microsoft Foundry Hosted Agents Responses adapter for Orka.

Its Orka harness server structure is derived from the classic adapter in
https://github.com/orka-agents/agent-runtime-foundry-classic, which was extracted
from https://github.com/orka-agents/orka under the MIT License. The Foundry-facing
lifecycle in this repository is a new implementation of the Hosted Agents
Responses and Sessions APIs.
